        "pageid": 71363635,
        "ns": 0,
        "title": "100th Black Market",
        "extract": "Barettofiriatachi no Yami-Ichiba ~ 100th Black Market (バレットフィリア達の闇市場 〜 100th Black Market; lit. \"Bulletphiles' Black Market\") is the 18.5th Touhou Project game. It was first announced at Touhou Yomoyama News on July 21, 2022, and released at the 100th Comiket on August 14, 2022, with a Steam release on August 14, 2022.",
